<title>USA: Edison sets $1.5 billion share buyback.</title>
<headline>Edison sets $1.5 billion share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>ROSEMEAD, Calif. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edison International said Thursday its board of directors approved the repurchase of up to $1.5 billion worth of its common shares.</p>
<p>This repurchase is in addition to an $800 million stock repurchase program which is substantially complete. As of May 14 the company had repurchased about 40 million shares for about $765 million.</p>
